@startuml AgentPay Browser Wallet Purchase Sequence
!theme plain
title AgentPay - Browser Wallet Purchase Through Shared Commerce

actor Buyer
participant "Hosted storefront" as Web
participant "AgentPay API" as API
participant "Buyer wallet" as Wallet
participant "x402 facilitator" as Facilitator
participant "Transaction service" as Transactions
participant "Seller API" as Seller
participant "Evidence service" as Evidence

Buyer -> Web : Select published product
Web -> API : Create immutable purchase intent\nchannel=browser
API --> Web : Frozen seller quote and approval requirement
Web -> API : Request paid route
API --> Web : Return x402 challenge
Buyer -> Wallet : Approve exact asset, network, amount, and destination
Web -> API : Retry with payment proof
API -> Facilitator : Verify payment proof
Facilitator --> API : Verified payment reference
API -> Transactions : Claim fulfillment once
Transactions -> Evidence : Append payment verification
Transactions -> Seller : Forward signed request
Seller --> Transactions : Return digital result
Transactions -> Evidence : Append delivery outcome
API --> Web : Return fulfillment and transaction status
@enduml
